  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1904.01 Scope. This part applies to all group or blanket insurance plans subject to RSA 415, RSA 420-A and RSA 420-B, except those coverages listed under RSA 415-A:3, I(d), (g), (h), (i), (j), (k) and (m).\n\nSource. #3164, eff 12-24-85; ss by #4287, eff 7-1-87; ss by #5656, eff 7-1-93; ss by #7017, INTERIM, eff 7-1-99, EXPIRED: 10-29-99\n\nNew. #8402, eff 8-1-05; ss by #10371, eff 8-1-13; ss by #13779, eff 10-12=23",
